  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ain o Salish Kendra (ASK) is one of the largest human rights organisations of the country. Sweden has been supporting ASK for the last few years.The present contribution is aimed to continue its legalaid, legal awareness, child rights, media campaign and advocacy activities for the interest of the vulnerable especially women and children.</narrative>
